{"n":3,"title":"The best time to visit my country","blurb":"Likes and dislikes, and a model web post","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Which season do you actually look forward to? Click one.","sub":"Здесь нет правильного ответа","options":[{"label":"spring"},{"label":"summer"},{"label":"autumn"},{"label":"winter"},{"label":"spring"},{"label":"summer"},{"label":"autumn"},{"label":"winter"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"season","pos":"n","ru":"время года, сезон","kk":"маусым","def":"one of the four parts of the year: spring, summer, autumn or winter","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-season.webp"},{"en":"festival","pos":"n","ru":"праздник, фестиваль","kk":"мереке, фестиваль","def":"a public event with music, food or dancing, usually held every year","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-festival.webp"},{"en":"trip","pos":"n","ru":"поездка","kk":"сапар","def":"a short journey to a place and back again","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-trip.webp"},{"en":"humid","pos":"adj","ru":"влажный и душный","kk":"ылғалды әрі тымырсық","def":"with a lot of water in the air, so the air feels heavy and sticky","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-humid.webp"},{"en":"damp","pos":"adj","ru":"сырой, влажный","kk":"дымқыл","def":"slightly wet, in a way that feels unpleasant","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-damp.webp"},{"en":"cloudy","pos":"adj","ru":"облачный","kk":"бұлтты","def":"with a lot of cloud in the sky and very little sun","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-cloudy.webp"},{"en":"pleasant","pos":"adj","ru":"приятный","kk":"жағымды","def":"enjoyable and comfortable — not too hot, not too cold, not too wet","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-pleasant.webp"},{"en":"uncomfortable","pos":"adj","ru":"некомфортный","kk":"қолайсыз","def":"making you feel physically unhappy, so that you cannot relax","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-uncomfortable.webp"},{"en":"nasty","pos":"adj","ru":"скверный, неприятный","kk":"жаман, жағымсыз","def":"very bad or unpleasant — the kind of weather you would rather avoid","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-nasty.webp"},{"en":"snowfall","pos":"n","ru":"снегопад","kk":"қар жауу","def":"an occasion when snow falls, or the amount of snow that falls","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-snowfall.webp"},{"en":"period","pos":"n","ru":"период, отрезок времени","kk":"кезең","def":"a stretch of time with a beginning and an end","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-period.webp"},{"en":"cold","pos":"adj","ru":"холодный","kk":"суық","def":"with a low temperature","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-cold.webp"},{"en":"hot","pos":"adj","ru":"жаркий","kk":"ыстық","def":"with a high temperature","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-hot.webp"},{"en":"light","pos":"n","ru":"свет","kk":"жарық","def":"the brightness from the sun or a lamp that lets you see things","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-light.webp"},{"en":"lightning","pos":"n","ru":"молния","kk":"найзағай","def":"the sudden bright flash in the sky during a storm","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-lightning.webp"},{"en":"pleasure","pos":"n","ru":"удовольствие","kk":"рахат, ләззат","def":"the feeling you have when you enjoy something","img":"/course/a2/img/l3-pleasure.webp"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"season","options":["время года, сезон","праздник, фестиваль","поездка","влажный и душный","сырой, влажный"],"answer":"время года, сезон","optionsKk":["маусым","мереке, фестиваль","сапар","ылғалды әрі тымырсық","дымқыл"],"answerKk":"маусым"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"festival","options":["праздник, фестиваль","приятный","некомфортный","скверный, неприятный","снегопад"],"answer":"праздник, фестиваль","optionsKk":["мереке, фестиваль","жағымды","қолайсыз","жаман, жағымсыз","қар жауу"],"answerKk":"мереке, фестиваль"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"trip","options":["поездка","холодный","жаркий","свет","молния"],"answer":"поездка","optionsKk":["сапар","суық","ыстық","жарық","найзағай"],"answerKk":"сапар"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"humid","options":["влажный и душный","сырой, влажный","облачный","приятный","некомфортный"],"answer":"влажный и душный","optionsKk":["ылғалды әрі тымырсық","дымқыл","бұлтты","жағымды","қолайсыз"],"answerKk":"ылғалды әрі тымырсық"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"damp","options":["сырой, влажный","период, отрезок времени","холодный","жаркий","свет"],"answer":"сырой, влажный","optionsKk":["дымқыл","кезең","суық","ыстық","жарық"],"answerKk":"дымқыл"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"cloudy","options":["облачный","приятный","некомфортный","скверный, неприятный","снегопад"],"answer":"облачный","optionsKk":["бұлтты","жағымды","қолайсыз","жаман, жағымсыз","қар жауу"],"answerKk":"бұлтты"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"I really <span class=\"hl\">love catching</span> fish in the sea."},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"I <span class=\"hl\">can't stand</span> large crowds."},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"I'm not <span class=\"hl\">keen on swimming</span> in the sea in the summer."},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"choice","title":"","prompt":"What form does the verb take after all of these?","options":["the base form — catch, swim, watch","to + the base form — to catch, to swim","the -ing form — catching, swimming, watching","it changes each time"],"answer":"the -ing form — catching, swimming, watching"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct form.","prompt":"I really enjoy ____ in the mountains.","options":["walking","to walk","walk"],"answer":"walking"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct form.","prompt":"She can’t stand ____ at airports.","options":["to wait","waiting","wait"],"answer":"waiting"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct form.","prompt":"He’s keen on ____ .","options":["cook","to cook","cooking"],"answer":"cooking"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct form.","prompt":"I don’t mind ____ .","options":["the cold","to cold","colding"],"answer":"the cold"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"How strong is it? Match the sentence to what the person really means. recycled: frequency","prompt":"“I don’t mind the rain.”","options":["I love it","I accept it","I hate it"],"answer":"I accept it"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"How strong is it? Match the sentence to what the person really means. recycled: frequency","prompt":"“I’m not keen on winter.”","options":["I love it","I have no opinion","I dislike it, politely"],"answer":"I dislike it, politely"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"How strong is it? Match the sentence to what the person really means. recycled: frequency","prompt":"“I quite like the cold.”","options":["a little bit positive","extremely positive","negative"],"answer":"a little bit positive"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"How strong is it? Match the sentence to what the person really means. recycled: frequency","prompt":"“I can’t stand humid weather.”","options":["I quite like it","I accept it","I hate it"],"answer":"I hate it"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"rows","title":"Listen once. Which season does each person choose?","sub":"","track":"Track_1.7.mp3","items":[{"q":"Faisal chooses…","options":["spring","summer","autumn","winter"],"answer":"winter"},{"q":"Marek chooses…","options":["spring","summer","autumn","winter"],"answer":"autumn"},{"q":"Gina chooses…","options":["spring","summer","autumn","winter"],"answer":"summer"}]},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Read it aloud to your teacher when it is finished.","sub":"Напиши ответ, затем проверь себя","placeholder":"Твой ответ…","model":"I love / really enjoy …-ing"},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Отметь, чему научился","sub":"Я могу…","items":["✓ say what you like and dislike — love, enjoy, don’t mind, not keen on, can’t stand","✓ use the right form after them — -ing , or a noun","✓ use the small words that force -ing — keen on, interested in, into, good at","✓ describe weather and seasons — humid, damp, pleasant, snowfall","✓ write a short web post recommending when to visit a place","✓ say how often you do something recycled — usually, hardly ever, every October"]}]}